review_comments.body:
The debounced function created by lodash's debounce on line 78 should be cancelled in componentWillUnmount to prevent memory leaks. Lodash debounced functions have a cancel method that should be called during cleanup.

Add this to the componentWillUnmount method:
```javascript
this.debouncedHandleChange.cancel();
```

This ensures that any pending debounced calls are cancelled when the component unmounts, preventing potential state updates on an unmounted component.
```suggestion
    window.removeEventListener('keydown', this.handleKeydown);
    if (this.debouncedHandleChange && this.debouncedHandleChange.cancel) {
      this.debouncedHandleChange.cancel();
    }
```

